62fcfd628c3515dd4aa1546.600x338.jpg?t=1773451773"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/ss_f4709bf8b1005356f8232f8a75dc4d8ebe66e084.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773451773","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402330/ss_f4709bf8b1005356f8232f8a75dc4d8ebe66e084.600x338.jpg?t=1773451773"}],"short_description":"This is an &quot;Arcade-style Beat 'em Up&quot; with &quot;Real-time Tactics&quot; and &quot;Action RPG&quot; elements. Choose to engage in a rampage or opt for stealth. After the main story, explore regions, collect items, battle foes, and develop your team.","steam_appid":3402330,"support_info":{"email":"bainenbainende@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Traditional Chinese","type":"game","website":null}